ng of medical information is an  example to follow for the future  European health data space which will  give a cross-border dimension to this  type of method another feature of the  Danish initiative is that artificial  intelligence is used to perform an  initial screening of information  the question is are processed with an  algorithm to show that if the patient is  fine and we do not need to talk with the  patient or see the patient some comes  out as we call it yellow to say if it's  necessary to make a telephone call for  the patient the other comes out red to  say it is necessary to see the patient  Pro is a useful tool for regularly  monitoring patients with chronic  diseases and allows doctors to be more  reactive even before the scheduled  consultation it's also help us to find  out who are the relevant patients to see  in this way when we process it with we  end up spending our time on the ill  patients and not on the patients who are  actually in a well-being situation with  a Chronicle disease  at a time when the sharing of medical  information is a critical issue for our  Health Care Systems patients have more  say than ever in helping the medical  industry create products and services  that are tailored to their experience  [Music]

